Patch: 006-fake-sdk-script
Reason: the scripted SDK takes its command from the message text; a runner sends its own prompts, so a test needs a script of commands
Upstream: ours
Pins: a DSL agent node runs on the Claude Agent adapter: the host tool, then submit, each model request through the proxy
---
